@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080

### Criar tarefa
# @name createTask
POST {{baseUrl}}/tasks
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Estudar Compose"
}

### Guardar o id retornado pelo POST
@taskId = {{createTask.response.body.id}}

### Listar tarefas
GET {{baseUrl}}/tasks

### Atualizar tarefa
PUT {{baseUrl}}/tasks/{{taskId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Estudar Compose",
  "done": true
}

### Deletar tarefa
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/tasks/{{taskId}}

### Testar validação (deve devolver 400)
POST {{baseUrl}}/tasks
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": ""
}

### Testar id inexistente (deve devolver 404)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/tasks/000000000000000000000000